 POSTING A MEETING AGENDA 

 Agendas must be posted  at least 48 hours in advance of the public meeting .  This means the completed agenda must be filed with the Town Clerk's office in advance of the 48 hour deadline to allow time to post.  
 The  legally required   posting place is the bulletin board outside Town Hall.    The website is a public convenience - but not the legally required place.  
 As a reminder, the Town Clerk's office is open Mon - Thu, 9am -3pm.   If you email an agenda on Fri/Sat/Sun, it will not be posted until Monda y.   
